A :REGION block holding a JSON payload read back with GetRegion(), with
the :ENDREGION on the payload's last line (`}:ENDREGION;`). The body is
opaque text: braces and quotes in it are not delimiters or strings, and
the complete closer ends the body wherever it sits (issue #304). Clean
(diag.unclosed_block, diag.unclosed_delimiter).
-- input.ssl --
:PROCEDURE BuildPayload;
	:PARAMETERS nTotal;
	:RETURN StrTran(GetRegion("Payload"), "$nTotal$", LimsString(nTotal));
:ENDPROC;
:REGION Payload;{
	"total": $nTotal$,
	"note": "it's (not) code"
}:ENDREGION;
-- format --
:PROCEDURE BuildPayload;
	:PARAMETERS nTotal;

	:RETURN StrTran(GetRegion("Payload"), "$nTotal$", LimsString(nTotal));
:ENDPROC;

:REGION Payload;{
	"total": $nTotal$,
	"note": "it's (not) code"
}:ENDREGION;
-- diagnostics --
-- diagnostics [--strict --info] --
